# Docker build context = whitelist (M2.7, ADR-0031). Everything is excluded except the sources the images
# are built from, so build directories, node directories, keystores, password files, databases and .git
# can never reach a build context or an image layer, wherever they happen to be in the working tree.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!CMakePresets.json
!LICENSE
!cmake/
!src/
!third_party/
!tools/ci/check_cxx_standard.py
!tools/deps/fetch_deps.py
!scripts/localnet/localnet.py
!docker/
# never, even inside whitelisted directories
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.password
**/*.keystore.json
**/priv_validator_key.json
**/priv_validator_state.json
**/node_key.json
**/*.mdb
**/__pycache__
